        </div>

        <div class="proof-grid">
          <article>
            <span>sample</span>
            <h3>Form samples</h3>
            <p>Scale, rim, foot, and hand-feel are tested before production starts.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>test</span>
            <h3>Glaze decisions</h3>
            <p>Surface language is documented with tiles, notes, and approval photos.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>fire</span>
            <h3>Firing schedule</h3>
            <p>Drying, bisque, glaze, and final cool-down are built into the delivery date.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>approve</span>
            <h3>Pickup / shipping</h3>
            <p>Finished pieces are checked, wrapped, and arranged for local pickup or shipping.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

